<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-011" chapter-id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan-izumo" source-id="s-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan-izumo">
  <p id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan-izumo:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan-izumo:p001:m0000" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6_A">明敬劉皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan-izumo:p001:m0006" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6_A">惠端</persName>彭城人光祿大夫<persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan-izumo:p001:m0015" ref="vus_7f1_rrz">道弘</persName>孫也<persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan-izumo:p001:m0019" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">高帝</persName>為明帝納之建元三年除西昌侯夫人永明七年卒葬江乘縣張山延興元年贈宣城王妃明帝即位追尊敬皇后贈父通直郎<persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan-izumo:p001:m0070" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6">景猷</persName>為金紫光祿大夫母<persName id="c-nanshi-011-liuhuiduan-izumo:p001:m0080" ref="q20_pas_ain">王氏</persName>平陽鄉君明帝崩改葬祔于興安陵</p>
</text>
